<title>USA: CWMBS Inc files $3.5 bln shelf offering.</title>
<headline>CWMBS Inc files $3.5 bln shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>CWMBS Inc filed Friday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf offering of up to $3.5 billion in mortgage pass-through certificates.</p>
<p>The Pasadena, Calif.-based company said the certificates will represent an interest in a pool of fixed rate mortgages on one- to four-family properties.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
